# NCAGP
### National Cyber Audit Governance Platform
    
**Sovereign cyber audit intelligence for Government of India**  
Built for NIC · Ministry of Electronics & Information Technology (MEITY)

[Features](#features) · [Architecture](#architecture) · [Quick Start](#quick-start) · [Setup Guide](#complete-setup-guide) · [API Docs](#api-reference) · [Security](#security-architecture)

</div>

---

## What Is NCAGP?

NCAGP is a full-stack, government-grade platform that serves as the **operating system for cyber audits** across all Indian government departments. It replaces fragmented email-based audit reports with a tamper-evident, role-enforced, real-time intelligence system.

```
It is NOT a scanner.
It is NOT a SIEM.
It is the permanent memory, accountability layer, and intelligence engine of cyber governance.
```

Once deployed:
- Audits stop being **events** — they become a **system**
- Risk becomes **measurable** in real time
- Evidence becomes **court-grade** and tamper-proof
- Vendors become **transparent** with scored KPIs
- Regulators get **real** data, not Word documents

---

## Features

| Category | Feature | Status |
|----------|---------|--------|
| **Auth & Security** | RS256 JWT (4096-bit asymmetric) | ✅ |
| | TOTP MFA (Google Authenticator / Authy) | ✅ |
| | Session revocation + account lockout | ✅ |
| | 7-role RBAC + PostgreSQL RLS | ✅ |
| **Findings Engine** | 8-state lifecycle state machine | ✅ |
| | SLA auto-calculation by severity | ✅ |
| | Recurring finding detection (2-year lookback) | ✅ |
| | National risk heatmap (weighted scoring) | ✅ |
| **Evidence** | SHA-256 hash — computed in browser before upload | ✅ |
| | Immutable storage — no delete, only supersede | ✅ |
| | File integrity verification endpoint | ✅ |
| | Inline preview (images + PDF) — no MinIO login needed | ✅ |
| **Audit Ledger** | SHA-256 hash-chained append-only ledger | ✅ |
| | DB trigger blocks UPDATE/DELETE | ✅ |
| | Chain integrity verification API | ✅ |
| **Scanner Ingestion** | Nessus / OpenVAS / SonarQube webhook | ✅ |
| | Batch ingestion (up to 500 findings) | ✅ |
| | Duplicate detection (24h window) | ✅ |
| **Intelligence** | Natural Language Query (Claude AI) | ✅ |
| | Rule-based anomaly detection | ✅ |
| | Department risk forecasting | ✅ |
| **Workflow** | 5-step remediation workflow (PRD §9) | ✅ |
| | Task management per finding | ✅ |
| | Audit CRUD lifecycle | ✅ |
| **Vendor Management** | Trust score + quality score KPIs | ✅ |
| | Nightly automated scoring job | ✅ |
| **Control Library** | 30 controls — ISO 27001 + NIST mapped | ✅ |
| **Reporting** | PDF risk report (pdfkit) | ✅ |
| | SLA breach email alerts (Gmail SMTP) | ✅ |
| **UI** | Role-specific dashboards (4 different views) | ✅ |
| | Dark theme with liquid glass design | ✅ |
| | Collapsible sidebar, government footer | ✅ |
| | Issue feedback widget | ✅ |

