## Starting the Project (Every Session)

**macOS — open 3 terminal tabs:**

```bash
# Tab 1 — MinIO
docker start ncagp-minio

# Tab 2 — Backend
cd ncagp/backend && npm run start:dev

# Tab 3 — Frontend
cd ncagp/frontend && npm run dev
```

**Windows — open 3 PowerShell windows:**

```powershell
# Window 1 — MinIO
docker start ncagp-minio

# Window 2 — Backend
Set-Location ncagp\backend; npm run start:dev

# Window 3 — Frontend
Set-Location ncagp\frontend; npm run dev
```

Then open **http://localhost:3001**

