## API Reference

### Authentication
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | None | Login — returns JWT |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/mfa/verify` | Partial JWT | Verify 6-digit TOTP code |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/logout` | JWT | Revoke session |
| `GET` | `/api/auth/mfa/status` | JWT | Check MFA enabled/disabled |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/mfa/setup` | JWT | Generate QR code for authenticator |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/mfa/enable` | JWT | Enable MFA after scanning QR |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/mfa/disable` | JWT | Disable MFA |

### Findings
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/findings` | JWT | List findings (org-scoped by RLS) |
| `POST` | `/api/findings` | JWT | Create finding |
| `PATCH` | `/api/findings/:id/status` | JWT | Transition finding state |
| `GET` | `/api/findings/:id/history` | JWT | Status change history |
| `GET` | `/api/findings/risk-heatmap` | JWT | National risk scores by department |
| `GET` | `/api/findings/:id/evidence` | JWT | List evidence for a finding |

### Evidence
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/findings/:id/evidence` | JWT | Upload evidence file (multipart) |
| `GET` | `/api/evidence` | JWT | List all evidence (role-scoped) |
| `GET` | `/api/evidence/:id/file` | JWT | Stream file from MinIO — no MinIO login needed |
| `GET` | `/api/evidence/:id/verify` | JWT | Verify SHA-256 integrity |
| `POST` | `/api/evidence/:id/supersede` | JWT | Replace evidence (immutable) |

### Ledger
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/ledger` | JWT | Query audit trail entries |
| `POST` | `/api/ledger/verify-chain` | JWT | Recompute all hashes — detect tampering |

### Tasks
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/tasks` | JWT | List all tasks (scoped) |
| `GET` | `/api/tasks/my` | JWT | Tasks assigned to me |
| `POST` | `/api/tasks` | JWT | Create remediation task |
| `PATCH` | `/api/tasks/:id` | JWT | Update task status |

### Audits
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/audits` | JWT | List audits |
| `GET` | `/api/audits/:id` | JWT | Audit detail + findings |
| `POST` | `/api/audits` | JWT | Create audit |
| `PATCH` | `/api/audits/:id` | JWT | Update audit status |

### Intelligence
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/intelligence/query` | JWT | Natural language query over findings |
| `POST` | `/api/intelligence/anomalies` | JWT | Run anomaly detection scan |
| `POST` | `/api/intelligence/risk-forecast` | JWT | Department risk forecast |

### Vendors
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/vendors` | JWT | All vendor scorecards |
| `GET` | `/api/vendors/:orgId/score` | JWT | Single vendor score |
| `POST` | `/api/vendors/:orgId/rescore` | NIC_ADMIN | Force rescore a vendor |
| `POST` | `/api/vendors/rescore-all` | NIC_ADMIN | Trigger nightly scoring manually |

### Scanner Ingestion (X-API-Key auth)
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/v1/ingest/scanner` | X-API-Key | Single finding from scanner |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/ingest/scanner/batch` | X-API-Key | Up to 500 findings |

### Reports
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/reports/national-risk` | JWT | Download PDF risk report |

---

## Where Data Is Stored

| Data | Location | How to view |
|------|----------|-------------|
| Findings, users, orgs | PostgreSQL `ncagp` DB | `psql -U ncagp_app -d ncagp -c "SELECT * FROM findings;"` |
| Evidence files | MinIO `ncagp-evidence` bucket | Via portal or `GET /api/evidence/:id/file` |
| Audit ledger | PostgreSQL `audit_ledger` table | `psql -U ncagp_app -d ncagp -c "SELECT * FROM audit_ledger ORDER BY timestamp DESC LIMIT 20;"` |
| Sessions | PostgreSQL `sessions` table | Auto-expire after 8h |
| Feedback issues | Browser localStorage | Key: `ncagp_feedback_issues` |

---

## Reset to Clean State (Testing)

```bash
# macOS
psql -U $(whoami) -d ncagp << 'EOF'
ALTER TABLE audit_ledger DISABLE TRIGGER ALL;
ALTER TABLE evidence      DISABLE TRIGGER ALL;
TRUNCATE TABLE sla_alert_log, api_keys, sessions, audit_ledger, evidence,
               finding_status_history, tasks, findings, assets, audits,
               users, organizations CASCADE;
ALTER TABLE audit_ledger ENABLE TRIGGER ALL;
ALTER TABLE evidence      ENABLE TRIGGER ALL;
EOF
docker exec ncagp-minio mc rm --recursive --force local/ncagp-evidence 2>/dev/null || true
cd backend && npx ts-node prisma/seed.ts && npx ts-node prisma/seed-controls.ts
```

**Windows (PowerShell):**
```powershell
$sql = @"
ALTER TABLE audit_ledger DISABLE TRIGGER ALL;
ALTER TABLE evidence DISABLE TRIGGER ALL;
TRUNCATE TABLE sla_alert_log, api_keys, sessions, audit_ledger, evidence, finding_status_history, tasks, findings, assets, audits, users, organizations CASCADE;
ALTER TABLE audit_ledger ENABLE TRIGGER ALL;
ALTER TABLE evidence ENABLE TRIGGER ALL;
"@
$sql | psql -U postgres -d ncagp

docker exec ncagp-minio mc rm --recursive --force local/ncagp-evidence
Set-Location backend
npx ts-node prisma/seed.ts
npx ts-node prisma/seed-controls.ts
```

---

## Security Architecture

| Layer | Control | File |
|-------|---------|------|
| JWT | RS256 4096-bit asymmetric — never symmetric | `auth/jwt.strategy.ts` |
| MFA | TOTP via speakeasy — no external service | `auth/mfa.service.ts` |
| Session revocation | DB table checked on every request | `auth/jwt.strategy.ts` |
| Account lockout | 5 failed attempts → 15 min lock | `auth/auth.service.ts` |
| RBAC | 7-role model with `@Roles()` decorator | `auth/guards/auth.guard.ts` |
| Multi-tenancy (app) | `OrgScopeGuard` on every controller | `auth/guards/auth.guard.ts` |
| Multi-tenancy (DB) | PostgreSQL RLS per request | `rls/rls.interceptor.ts` |
| Evidence immutability | DB trigger blocks DELETE | `001_security_hardening.sql` |
| Ledger immutability | DB trigger blocks UPDATE + DELETE | `001_security_hardening.sql` |
| Evidence integrity | SHA-256 hashed pre-upload | `evidence/evidence.service.ts` |
| File safety | MIME type allowlist (10 types) | `evidence/evidence.service.ts` |
| Transport | Helmet + HSTS headers | `main.ts` |
| Rate limiting | 100 req/min global throttle | `app.module.ts` |
| Data residency | All data India only (no cloud calls) | Storage metadata |
| Feedback | Only NIC_ADMIN can manage/delete feedback | `FeedbackWidget.tsx` |

