## Troubleshooting

### macOS — `psql: command not found`
```bash
export PATH="/opt/homebrew/opt/postgresql@15/bin:$PATH"
# Add to ~/.zshrc for permanent fix
```

### Windows — `psql is not recognized`
Add PostgreSQL bin to PATH: `C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\15\bin`

### MinIO container not starting
```bash
docker rm ncagp-minio
# Then re-run the docker run command from Step 3
```

### `JWT_PRIVATE_KEY` error on backend start
The PEM key must have `\n` not literal newlines. Use the auto-format scripts in Step 4.

### Evidence upload fails with `KMS not configured`
Remove the `x-amz-server-side-encryption` header from `storage.service.ts` — local MinIO doesn't support KMS.

### Port 3000 already in use
```bash
# macOS / Linux
lsof -ti:3000 | xargs kill -9

# Windows
netstat -ano | findstr :3000
taskkill /PID <PID> /F
```

### `bcrypt` module error on Windows
```powershell
npm install --save bcrypt
npm install --save-dev @types/bcrypt
# If still failing, use bcryptjs instead
npm install --save bcryptjs && npm install --save-dev @types/bcryptjs
```

---

## Immutable Audit Ledger

Every action creates a hash-chained ledger entry:

```
event_id → user_id → action → entity → timestamp → hash_prev → hash_current
```

Verify chain integrity at any time:
```bash
curl -s -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/ledger/verify-chain \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{}' | python3 -m json.tool

# Expected response:
# {
#   "isValid": true,
#   "totalEntries": 142,
#   "verifiedAt": "2026-04-06T..."
# }
```

---

## Scanner Integration Example

```bash
# 1. Generate API key in Settings → API Keys
# 2. Push finding from Nessus/OpenVAS/SonarQube:

curl -X POST https://your-domain.gov.in/api/v1/ingest/scanner \
  -H "X-API-Key: ncagp_sk_your_key_here" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "audit_id": "your-audit-uuid",
    "severity": "critical",
    "title": "SSL Certificate Expired",
    "description": "Port 443 certificate on portal.mha.gov.in expired",
    "host": "portal.mha.gov.in",
    "port": "443",
    "cve": ["CVE-2023-1234"],
    "cvss_score": 9.1,
    "plugin_id": "56984"
  }'
```

